    limit:'No archival case file or accident report has been inspected, and the catalog search cannot establish that no file survives. The Board’s request page says accident reports and attending-physician reports are private and require signed authorization from an employee, employer, or legal representative; it may withhold those materials even if other case records exist. No request was submitted.',
    next:'Use the WCB public-record process or consult the State Archives in person, asking first whether the Industrial Board’s underlying Smith v. Leslie claim/award or docket survives and what portions are publicly inspectable. Do not assume the 76-28 inspection boxes contain the compensation file.'
